{"time": 1760897208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "412960858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（看书也不是什么坏事.jpg）"}
{"time": 1760897210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1569892426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2033442981]\"好诶！那今天我出去玩啦?\"拉着伊恩，\"今天去哪?\""}
{"time": 1760897247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1155956008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(嘶，这么一说可能也对，但是40木工可能是对木工有兴趣吧)"}
{"time": 1760897261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2066088190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（然后旷工吗.jpg）"}
{"time": 1760897275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "544638295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你也互搏）"}
{"time": 1760897284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1775084090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？我本来是准备去林子里练习魔法的,不过要是舒茉只是在一旁看的话会很无聊吧...”思考一下该去干什么"}
{"time": 1760897357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1479444745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我说我们一起去图书馆看书是不是太逆天了（）"}
{"time": 1760897377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1448347853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉有什么想去的地方吗”"}
{"time": 1760897516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "731356729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没有啦，嗯，我看着伊恩练习吧。\"思考一番点点头"}
{"time": 1760897555, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1497702797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，虽然自己不会，但是还是挺感兴趣的。伊恩要好好演示哦?\""}
{"time": 1760897650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "117738026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那既然舒茉感兴趣的话.....不过要先帮阿姨把买的东西拿回去吧”"}
{"time": 1760897678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "968023256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“林子里？”舒茉的妈妈皱了皱眉，看起来有些担心"}
{"time": 1760897821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1173107326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啦，妈，不会有什么事的。\"凑到她面前撒娇，\"只是看一看，很快就回来。\""}
{"time": 1760897871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1865203898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，不过林子里确实可能会有危险吧，我们还是去别的地方吧”"}
{"time": 1760898004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "469557714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吧，伊恩也坚持的话。嗯...\"仔细思考，\"去我家院子吗？\""}
{"time": 1760898058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "983313623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“木料厂里就有大把空地的。”她想了想，补充到“反正大家都见过了……啊，到我了。两斤前腿肉，然后……”*她在那堆亮闪闪的原矿堆里挑着"}
{"time": 1760898188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "891790492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跟着在一旁看看她挑选矿石，自己有些看不懂，但是假装很懂的点点脑袋。"}
{"time": 1760898290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "666945076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉很懂这些矿石吗”看到眼前繁多的矿石感觉有点头昏眼花"}
{"time": 1760898389, "type": "recv", "message_id": "393482976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "最后她挑出一块透亮的、直径约两寸的锆石，又捡出两粒拇指大小的月光石结了账。加在一起也有个百来枚银币的开销"}
{"time": 1760898406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1204070953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我想起来小晶块也有个大几十金币一个）"}
{"time": 1760898423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1702840251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是总感觉一上来就是大几十几百金币有点变态，先银币吧.jpg）"}
{"time": 1760898452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1820088743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=93079CD5B5BBD7B2ADB7CA54512554F6.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSl1TQukK2xZc7szcBm7mdvV9pHuhiJjw8g_wookpud9fGwkAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQVDlkjrvdZUb1EnYBb8jKQXoCT3WCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMC2iHw17payKvvxpmrUIvXly5V71YAZrGidUUVe67piX5fIXTb_khQMFa2vuc6fmeg,file_size=247689]"}
