{"time": 1760967217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1168367804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你也看不完）"}
{"time": 1760967228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "675571159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（大火我知道（）"}
{"time": 1760967365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "326248875", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=144033286][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 看看大火"}
{"time": 1760967638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "735098894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "大约三十年前，附近的格兰之森深处，原本是精灵们的居所……那时候还没有埃尔文前线，人与精灵来往不算多，但关系还算得上友好。那场大火之后，精灵一夜之间销声匿迹，也有魔物偶尔出没"}
{"time": 1760967715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1593558933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "因此，埃尔文前哨站被建立。后来组织过深入格兰之森探查精灵聚居地旧址的探查，但是除了焚烧痕迹，什么也没留下"}
{"time": 1760967797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2096965810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉收获颇丰"}
{"time": 1760967817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1448247116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（颇丰在哪）"}
{"time": 1760967887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1470841145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然这些以前零零散散的听别人提过，不过跟看一遍书相比，还是书上写的更详尽一些，看眼时间"}
{"time": 1760967916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "304827146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我其实想说看完都要下午了）"}
{"time": 1760967933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "317537209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那午饭呢）"}
{"time": 1760968030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1594556096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之你看的草率，专有名词太多了，阅读起来很有难度。大火倒是看得轻松易懂，没花什么功夫。放下是时候你才注意到空气中飘着的饭菜香气"}
{"time": 1760968135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1621146219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你看到舒茉的母亲从厨房里出来，擦了擦手，又去敲舒茉的门"}
